    <briefdescription>
<para>All interaction poses for one hand. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores one <computeroutput>hand_interaction_pose_data</computeroutput> for each <computeroutput>interaction_pose_type</computeroutput>. The gesture-strength value and readiness flag for each pose are carried on the <computeroutput>hand_interaction_pose_data</computeroutput> itself rather than at this level, since they are semantically bound to their corresponding pose type. </para>
